  "content": {
    "prompt": "Write Python code that sets a to 5 and b to 9. If a is greater than b, set a to a minus b and add 2 to b. Otherwise, set b to b minus a and add 1 to a. Print a and then print b.",
    "source_code": "a = 5\nb = 9\nif a > b:\n    a = a - b\n    b = b + 2\nelse:\n    b = b - a\n    a = a + 1\nprint(a)\nprint(b)\n"
